 "remarks": "Tucked away in the heart of town yet offering remarkable privacy, this rare standalone 3-bedroom condo lives like a single-family home - just steps from New Canaan's shops, restaurants, and train. Built in 2007 and offering approximately 2,579 square feet across four finished levels, the home features elegant custom moldings and millwork, French doors, and beautifully scaled living spaces. The finished third floor and lower level provide exceptional flexibility for office, guest, fitness, or media use. With three full baths and one half bath, the turnkey interior opens to a covered stone patio with a retractable awning and a small private yard perfect for outdoor entertaining. A rare in-town offering for exceptional living!",
